{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act53side", "eventName": "直到大地变成一颗酸橙", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TO-5", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "勇敢的短耳朵", "storyInfo": "虽然塔妮救上来的人并没能帮她找到奶奶丢失的怀表，但也告知了她当年事情的真相。终于聚在一起的女孩们十分开心——她们齐心协力，让今天有了个美好的结局！", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g6_deckdark", "xScale": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "y": 20.0, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.5, "fillto": 0.15, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.5, "fillto": 0.15, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$victorianormal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "BackgroundTween", "attributes": {"image": "76_g6_deckdark", "duration": 5.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.15, "fillto": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.15, "fillto": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g6_deckdark", "fadetime": 2.0, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天真的好丢人，手臂其实伤得没那么重，却吓得魂飞魄散，给你添了这么多麻烦......", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我听他们说你来找我其实是想问问当年你奶奶的事，唉，当年的事其实是这样的啦......", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当时太阳谷内部不太和睦，虽然有家族的领头人出来说话，但大家明里暗里还是会争抢好矿脉的开采权。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那时我跟着妈妈去食堂吃饭，半路觉得矿场那边很有趣，我又很喜欢打洞，就趁着大人们说话，偷偷跑过去打了一个洞下去玩......", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$2"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这也太危险了吧——", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$2"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噗，你也是自己跑到井下去的，还好意思说这个。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘿嘿。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "反正下去以后我越挖越深，等回过神来觉得肚子很饿的时候，已经不知道自己在哪里了。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "妈妈和我说，是伊娜拉女士听到了我的跺脚声，觉得不对劲，没有经过任何人同意，独自把我救了上来。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她是个很厉害的术师，因为情况紧急，用源石技艺在井下开了一条近路。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这个举动的动静太大，又牵扯到工人家属的安全问题，最终引来了上面的合规部门。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这样一来，争矿脉的两拨人都恨上了伊娜拉女士，觉得是对方派来捣乱的。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尤其是总部发现他们其实真的有点不择手段......造假、斗殴......", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我被困不久，太阳谷的人就发现了，本来不应该等伊娜拉女士来救。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是他们相互推卸责任，想把我遭遇意外这件事包装成对方的过错，争得开采权，耽误了时间......", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以最后谁都没拿到开采权！", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊......原来是这样......", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以就只是我贪玩不小心把自己困住了......唉，丢人。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有啦！我小时候也做过很多糗事，我第一次去泡澡的时候特别兴奋，一直在跺脚，结果把地漏踩坏了，一家人都没得泡了。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈......", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么一说，虽然我没有奶奶那样厉害的源石技艺——", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——啊，对哦！维修员小姐，奶奶当时有没有在太阳谷落下什么东西？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "留下的东西？伊娜拉女士确实落下了一个东西......", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔妮的眼睛都亮了起来。"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$2"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真的？是什么！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#6$2"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就是这个啊。", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_slapcloth_light", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "维修员拍了拍她身后那个巨大的电钻。"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的幸运电钻！伊娜拉女士当时没拿走，后来也没来要，这个电钻就由我拿来用了！", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "为了能够熟练运用这个电钻，我辛辛苦苦练了好久的手臂肌肉呢！", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊娜拉女士当时说我小小年纪就能打那么长的洞很厉害，我以后肯定能成为一个很厉害的挖洞的人！", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她果然没说错吧！", "name": "太阳谷维修员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2358_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g6_deckdark", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们聊完啦！虽然还是没有找到奶奶的施术单元，但我知道了奶奶不是之前那些人说的“坏人”！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，什么奶奶不是坏人？你们在说什么？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对哦，我们今天一直忙到现在才有空聊天！", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "累死我了啦......哦，已经晚上了！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#2$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有了太阳的照耀，雷姆必拓的夜晚一下子就冷了下来。"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一阵风吹过，嘉辛塔忍不住打了一个冷战。"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2", "posfrom": "300,0", "posto": "100,0", "duration": 0.6}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "很冷吗？来来来，我们挤一挤，卡特斯们最喜欢的取暖方式！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1", "posfrom": "-300,0", "posto": "-100,0", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也要我也要......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇，你们看——", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#1$2"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁莉娜伸手指向甲板下方。"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$skydome_intro", "key": "$skydome_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_lightup", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "76_g7_deckbright", "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夜幕降临，而矿场中却越发明亮，仿佛真的有一轮太阳即将升起。少女们抱作一团，兴奋得大叫出声。"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$2"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "开心，太开心了！我们今天一起做成了一件大事呢！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$2"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我救上来了人，阿梅修好了塔！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#17$2"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯嗯！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但说实话，还是阿梅更厉害。要是没有阿梅，我可能也得在巷道里哭着等人来救了。", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有没有......我哪有那么厉害......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明明就是有的呀！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "几个人正说话的工夫，一小片又一小片的光芒在黑夜中亮起，很快，整个矿区都亮了起来。"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "巴顿先生跟我说了，多亏远程通讯系统修好，明天就可以在矿区大规模排查各种问题和隐患了。", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#13$1"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那现在亮灯是为了......？", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#13$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃，可能是调试？或者就只是单纯想庆祝一下？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你在做的事情明明就很厉害。", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#16$1"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是、是的......我也觉得......能让相隔很远的人交流......是件很厉害的事。", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#16$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别像在说别人的事情似的，这不是你自己研究的东西吗？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#16$1"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......嗯。是啊。", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#16$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等你帮纵贯红土公司把这些塔修好之后，有什么打算吗？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我之前只想回家看看爸爸妈妈，但现在却觉得......我不想让旅途结束在大铁屯。", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁，我能跟你和塔妮一起去南境吗？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尽管夜色深沉，嘉辛塔的眼睛却闪闪发亮。"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在路上听过南境的事了。我想去看看。", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#4$2"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#4$2"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "安洁，当初你决定要去南境的时候皮塔小姐也劝过你的哦，你不也没听吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原来还有这种事情？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......的确，去南境是我自己决定承担的责任。但你们毕竟不一样，你们没做错任何事......", "name": "安洁莉娜"}, "figure_art": "avg_1015_aglna2_1#2$2"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#3$2"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没做错事就不能去南境吗？", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#3$2"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "想想看，嘉辛塔陪阿梅解决了通讯塔的问题，你帮我救了人，还确认了奶奶的故事......我们配合得很默契啊！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们会是你的助力，而不是阻碍的！", "name": "塔妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对呀！想想塔妮，想想阿梅！阿梅的技术一定能帮到大家——", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1"}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃，抱歉，阿梅，我不是想强迫你去南境......", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......不！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我、我也想去南境！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅？", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等......等我修好剩下的那些塔......我就不欠公司任何东西了！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们、他们对我那么坏，我也不想给他们打工了......我要去南境测试我的技术！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我其实不光带了换修用的通讯核心，还带了一个小型化的便携式通讯站！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果在南境和大铁屯中间那块危险区的阻隔下，我的技术都能稳定传输数据，那我......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#10$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我，我就可以完全抛开公司......自己做了！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "......是啊！", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿梅，在巴顿先生的办公室里，我记得你说过你有一个理想——", "name": "嘉辛塔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1"}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是、是......", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是用我的技术......连通整片大地......整个泰拉！", "name": "阿梅利亚"}, "figure_art": "avg_4236_tmslot_1#7$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "150,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement_heavy2", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘉辛塔激动得一把抱住阿梅利亚。"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "